    <Placemark>
      <name>弁財天</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6EvTLDj0EAI-qjXEARFsUfD889Z7BJ70eQg28m9VP5V880KLAjeUBWPEwjVhI7NR2mqHp1w-3JkU0vDkwasOxwMJsSi3uKKDZl7fszPltFJb4kuuunKnJOV05IEdHfmpgpAo7VspGf4LQQikMbP_BfLWnYFqAdOvkYtttL0qiNvPCdSJgKrsqhq5NUROQRk5SL9EtpT6hfJZlqEWgq2kghTHTHEEfDXOhV_Ysc_1h8UDtBOXjoo2N6e5Iru-5vTW3IyWOtDyXBFfOC2tS7pFFPtI6BpGvpDWAZVGSKJoxoNih4qR-s9jAL6hr3yQ3-Pbqfc8uZVOt6E9ajflNqd_Ht5wcVsCBw3K5_tfHmNkMrkpXerkpPn2_Fh5G4q49uDla0Hnrzu9lKyec4rywAZvd3-lm8aQhnrKW4EQQNYplGrQmURtn3zsSftSqCz2FllMP5sJAH-dw8V83YDWR_wzaMpE2MYpJa4Zd43DQkKa04xE5LfIni0Svk7HPEgoZ0CnlXZ5DtXHJMXiaBNe7wcBsWkPU-HCOi_EuKVTNPpUJHJYSv7Sxss2pjP8yumxzLoDhlQ3HUYpWbyv23vTkTYeAjI6XtKWb8LUKOVzidnXX7R8HY2WvYs4TTEnwumFFJ7Ccrwh7R54OgxiSx3hDRRYErdNkNtTlLWG82wpBqddEZ4qeCN0njgr85VtA1zgVnovFwMSvWupolWH2g4K3HyxHTlRtqJA" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>「火防稲荷より東に50m、3体とも弁財天」<br><br>「　弁才天　荒川（右岸）<br>　埼玉県大里郡大里町津田<br>　稲荷社の東50m、参道脇に<br>　祀られている。<br>　３体とも弁財天だと思われる。<br>　手前の弁才天女の台座には<br>　ソと思われる種子。(水辺の神様その8)」]]></description>
