      <name>水神宮</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GwIx7QOBSWKiAo8QftLGCBv7U-D8Xfegh11_TArSSFW1Re0H7zgM6VfE-3pHpm17pPfwx7G69I6XppuivGK4j2QyRZ-sEfPE0KjaXiIAsCFykff2xr6scEP6W-VYWxD-x5fJhdAMCVl3i25-VJsn8EEwqKdLoq-wxgcdXw99xbn3UZ5wDqaONomQtYmK8eNg-eCnVUIp22-Ehyfukd18iWmDvfmK-KfxW67Y_OkouIfHhN34f2AQrGucwA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>水神宮　槻川（柳町橋の右岸橋詰）<br><br>埼玉県比企郡小川町下里<br>明治17年（1884）12月建立。昭和25年（1950）遷宮。緑泥片岩を使った高さ87cm、幅46cmの大きな水神宮<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GwTKfe2n_GMtARaK3PTicA3J9Gsn_U9QdUrEQGHTNsxWzyKQM3ncGG3R-z2OigIYdqJdSLrDWLw3HzDK786Ahfk2PQZxj5Pf51RG9o6Eq76F0a12a86pL7WChlf078tWp9TVy1LVQUL6Wdld8_VEeu_2UPI05R7O4WhrsOUO160GSYMrntUEIa8H2iSz6x6AOYxdfK3Yzy7s2vPr5XVMhfNgAVZo_KDhikJknomeGlbh6Wmg5os-GQjEhI?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
